<!-- Capsule, the vehicle of the void of the seed (T448, ADR-0234): what the kernel puts at the landing of every land of the void, docked
     with its stern against the edge. 2.5 × 4 tiles, two high, at 16 voxels a tile; the stern (low y) has the hatch, the bow (high y) the
     controls and the window. No roof: from above one sees who is aboard; a hoop over the middle, above the head of whoever walks the deck.
     A box of an even side has its middle on a half voxel. -->
